      "sha256": "e6b957ee9e8b3a3728e084404e36b9fa224d75bc02eec22f9b96279992e3184f",
      "bytes_read": 2621,
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "line": 22,
          "text": "The Polymarket CTF Exchange is an exchange protocol that facilitates atomic swaps between [Conditional Tokens Framework(CTF)](https://docs.gnosis.io/conditionaltokens/) ERC1155 assets and an ERC20 collateral asset."
        },
        {
          "line": 23,
          "text": ""
        },
        {
          "line": 24,
          "text": "It is intended to be used in a hybrid-decentralized exchange model wherein there is an operator that provides offchain matching services while settlement happens on-chain, non-custodially."
        },
